  "releaseNotes": "🆕 What’s New\n\nExpanded README.md with step-by-step usage instructions for RS.Dapper.Utility.\n\nAdded sample code snippets for common scenarios:\n\nInsert, Update, Delete, and Get operations with IDapperRepository\n\nUsing IDapperExecutor for stored procedures\n\nPaging and filtering examples\n\nImproved documentation for database switching (SQL Server ↔ MySQL ↔ PostgreSQL).\n\nProvided before vs. after examples to showcase how RS.Dapper.Utility simplifies code.\n\n✅ Why This Matters\n\nEasier onboarding for new developers\n\nFaster adoption in real-world projects\n\nClearer demonstration of productivity gains",
